# A closed loft held square at its first and last profiles:
# loft_ring.tlspr's smooth loft through six circles, its screen shown
# from the group list, closed into a ring by [closed] on its last row,
# then how it leaves the first profile given 1 and how it reaches the
# last 0.5 by their [change]; the screen, then the solid checked, a ring
# with no caps.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 407 330
twdown L 407 330
twup L 407 330
twmove 236 267
twdown L 236 267
twup L 236 267
edit 1
twmove 236 287
twdown L 236 287
twup L 236 287
edit 0.5
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
